    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "At Hali, your rent includes Virgin Media WiFi and TV, complimentary wellness classes, premium resident amenities and exclusive community events.\r\n\r\nCherrywood offers the best of connected city living and outdoor lifestyle. Located directly on the Green Line Luas, residents enjoy seamless access to Dublin City Centre while being surrounded by landscaped parks, sports facilities and coastal walks.\r\n\r\nDesigned around wellbeing, connection and convenience, Hali offers an exceptional range of resident amenities, including:\r\n–   Six resident Club Houses\r\n–   The Sky Gym with panoramic mountain and sea views\r\n–   The Wellness Suite with saunas and studios\r\n–   Dedicated work zones, meeting spaces and focus booths\r\n–   Resident-only events and experiences\r\n–   Six roof terraces and landscaped outdoor spaces with playgrounds\r\n\r\nMore than just an apartment, Hali is a professionally managed rental community where residents can live, work, relax and connect.\r\n\r\nBook a viewing today and discover the Hali lifestyle for yourself."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "More than just a two-bedroom apartment, Hali offers a vibrant rental community designed around wellbeing, connection and convenience in the heart of Cherrywood. Available in both apartment and duplex layouts, these spacious homes feature bright open-plan living areas, two generous double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, contemporary bathrooms, integrated appliances, private outdoor balconies and energy-efficient A-rated living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Enjoy exclusive access to:\r\n–   The Sky Gym with panoramic mountain and sea views\r\n–   Four complimentary wellness classes each week\r\n–   Hali discounts with on-site fitness partner Collective Fitness\r\n–   Six roof terraces\r\n–   Sauna facilities\r\n–   Social lounges and six Club Houses (available for private bookings)\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living with:\r\n–   Enterprise-level Virgin Media Wi-Fi\r\n–   Dedicated work zones, focus booths and meeting spaces\r\n–   Smart technology throughout the development\r\n–   Resident app for bookings, updates and support\r\n–   MyPup parcel lockers for secure 24/7 package collection\r\n\r\nLife at Hali includes:\r\n–   Curated resident and family events throughout the year\r\n–   Exclusive Hali Connect resident magazine\r\n–   Dedicated on-site Management Team\r\n–   Access to on-site YUKÕ car-sharing vehicles\r\n\r\nPerfectly located in South Dublin with:\r\n–   Direct access to the Luas Green Line\r\n–   Three nearby parks with tennis courts, sports facilities and playgrounds\r\n–   Perfectly positioned between the mountains and the sea\r\n\r\nExperience the Hali lifestyle for yourself. Get in touch with our Leasing Team today to book a viewing and explore our apartments, amenities and community.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Advertised rents are “from” rates and vary depending on apartment size, layout, floor level and orientation. Contact our leasing team for current availability and pricing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2-A3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Hali is located in the heart of Cherrywood, Dublin 18, with the Green Luas Line quite literally on your doorstep. Just steps from both Cherrywood and Brides Glen stops, residents enjoy seamless access to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Please contact our team for more information.\r\nPSRA License Number: 001806."
      }
